   710                              <1> .resetIds:
   711                              <1> ;We reset the volume id string and label to the default for the 
   712                              <1> ; volume before the reset!
   713 00000829 50                  <1>     push rax
   714 0000082A 53                  <1>     push rbx
   715 0000082B 51                  <1>     push rcx
   716 0000082C 56                  <1>     push rsi
