   746                              <1> .updateBpb:
   747                              <1> ;------------------------------------------------------
   748                              <1> ;Updates the BPB fields in drvBlk for the BPB on disk
   749                              <1> ; or failing, for the BPB indicated by the media byte.
   750                              <1> ;Never called on Fixed devs in normal operation.
   751                              <1> ;------------------------------------------------------
