  2484                              <1> .drvBlkTbl:
  2485                              <1> ;All drives start with Sectors/Cluster as -1 to indicate not initialised.
  2486                              <1> ;All drives start with Media Descripter as 0 (invalid type)
  2487                              <1> ;All drives start with dAccTime at -1 to force "uncertain" read for remdevs
  2488                              <1> ;All drives present 63 Cylinders (only valid as a field on fixed disks)
  2489                              <1> ;All drives have as an alt BPB, a 1.44Mb 3.5" Floppy.
  2490                              <1>     %push
  2491                              <1>     %assign i 0
  2492                              <1>     %rep drvBlkTblL
  2493                              <1>     istruc drvBlk
